# Deep Agents Repository - Comprehensive Architectural Analysis

## 1. Project Identity & Purpose

**Deep Agents** is a production-ready, opinionated agent harness built on top of LangChain and LangGraph. It's marketed as "batteries-included" — providing sensible defaults out of the box while remaining fully extensible. The core philosophy is stated in the README:

> "An opinionated agent that runs out of the box. Extend, override, or replace any piece."

**Problem domain**: Long-horizon, multi-step autonomous work by AI agents — research, coding, content creation, data analysis. It abstracts over the complexity of managing agent state, filesystem access, sub-agent delegation, context overflow, and human approval loops.

**Repository location**: [libs/deepagents/](libs/deepagents/) — core SDK only. This is the foundation; satellite packages ([libs/code/](libs/code/), [libs/cli/](libs/cli/)) build specialized experiences on top.

**Tagline**: From [README.md](README.md) — "The batteries-included agent harness."

