- **`deepagents deploy`** — upsert agent to LangSmith managed platform.
- **`deepagents agents list`** — list workspace agents.
- **`dcode`** — interactive terminal agent REPL (via `deepagents-code` package).
- **`dcode -x "prompt"`** — headless mode (single run, exit).

