## 19. Data Flow Diagram (Textual) — One Request End-to-End

```
USER: "Research LangGraph and summarize"
    |
    v
agent.invoke({"messages": [HumanMessage("Research...")]})
    |
    v
LangGraph starts graph execution
    |
    v
Middleware.before_agent() [setup]
    ├─ SkillsMiddleware: Loads available skills, injects into system prompt
    ├─ MemoryMiddleware: Loads AGENTS.md, injects into system prompt
    ├─ FilesystemMiddleware: Prepares filesystem tools (ls, read, write, etc.)
    └─ SubAgentMiddleware: Registers subagent handler for `task` tool
    |
    v
Model request assembled:
    system_message = [USER] + [BASE profile] + [SUFFIX profile]
    + [memory content] + [skill descriptions]
    tools = [filesystem tools] + [execute] + [task] + [user tools]
    input_messages = [HumanMessage("Research...")]
    |
    v
Middleware.wrap_model_call() [before model]
    └─ AnthropicPromptCachingMiddleware: Injects cache_control markers
    |
    v
Model inference (e.g., Claude Sonnet):
    → Decides to use `task` tool to delegate to research subagent
    → Returns AIMessage with tool_call: name="task", args={"subagent_name": "...", ...}
    |
    v
Tool dispatch:
    |
    ├─ PatchToolCallsMiddleware: Checks for dangling tool calls (patches if needed)
    |
    └─ Handle tool call (task):
        |
        ├─ SubAgentMiddleware intercepts:
        |   ├─ Looks up subagent spec by name
        |   ├─ Compiles subagent via create_deep_agent() [recursive]
        |   ├─ Invokes subagent with isolated context
        |   └─ Subagent runs through its own middleware stack
        |       ├─ Runs web search via `execute` + shell
        |       ├─ Reads search results via `read_file`
        |       ├─ Calls model to synthesize findings
        |       └─ Returns summary in ToolMessage
        |
        └─ Result: ToolMessage(tool_call_id="...", content="Summary of LangGraph")
    |
    v
State update:
    messages += [AIMessage(...tool_call...), ToolMessage(...result...)]
    (DeltaChannel reducer stores only the new messages)
    |
    v
SummarizationMiddleware check:
    if token_count > threshold:
        → Summarize old messages
        → Store in `/conversation_history/{session_id}.md`
        → Keep only recent N messages
    |
    v
Loop: Go back to model inference
    → Model sees the ToolMessage result
    → Decides to use `write_file` to save the summary
    → FilesystemMiddleware handles: checks permissions, writes to backend
    |
    v
Repeat until model produces final response (no more tool calls)
    |
    v
Model returns: AIMessage(content="I've researched LangGraph and saved a summary to summary.md")
    |
    v
Graph completes
    |
    v
Checkpointer saves state (via DeltaChannel, only new messages persisted)
    |
    v
Return result to caller:
    agent.invoke(...) → result = {"messages": [...], ...}
```

